+
+These commands use Linux shell syntax (macOS uses the same syntax but was not tried). On Windows, read the PowerShell paragraph below first. Each command goes in its own terminal window. Start every window from the repository folder (the folder that holds `README.md`) and switch the `.venv` on again in each new window (README, "Try it"). The demo server (the one program `demo_only.fakes_server`, see "Words used here" in the README) plays the made-up CRM and the made-up mail outbox at once, and the desk needs it running first. By default the desk keeps its database file in the folder `./data` (setting `DESK_DB_PATH`, `docs/settings.md`); "the database folder" below means that folder.
