+        "`--max-unknown N`, default 0",
+        "`--max-unknown 100000`, which allows any number",
+        "a blind mail system and a keyed CRM",
+        "It ran 300 rounds.",
+        "385 stops in all: 229 at a named crash point",
+        "156 by SIGKILL",
+        "9154 leads",
+        "197 follow-ups ended UNKNOWN, all in 70 of the 300 rounds",
+        "Of the 9154 leads, 54 had no email (all 54 were UNKNOWN) and 9100 had exactly 1 email",
+        "includes the 143 UNKNOWN follow-ups whose email had left",
+        "no lead had 2 emails",
+        "failed in those 70 rounds and passed in the other 230",
+        "not in this repository",
+    ):
